  RUSSIAN FEDERATION / РОССИЙСКАЯ ФЕДЕРАЦИЯ
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  1. Constitution of the Russian Federation (Article 44 — freedom of
     creativity, protection of intellectual property)

  2. Civil Code of the Russian Federation (Part Four) of 18.12.2006
     N 230-FZ:
     • Part IV. Section VII. Rights to results of intellectual activity
     • Chapter 70. Copyright (Articles 1255–1288)
     • Chapter 71. Rights related to copyright (Articles 1303–1327)
     • Article 1229. Exclusive right
     • Article 1255. Copyright
     • Article 1259. Objects of copyright
     • Article 1265. Right of authorship and right to author's name
     • Article 1266. Right to inviolability of a work
     • Article 1270. Infringement of exclusive right
     • Article 1271. Copyright protection mark
     • Article 1299. Technical protection measures
     • Article 1300. Copyright management information
     • Article 1301. Liability for infringement of exclusive right

  3. Criminal Code of the Russian Federation of 13.06.1996 N 63-FZ:
     • Article 146. Violation of copyright and related rights

  4. Code of Administrative Offences of 30.12.2001 N 195-FZ:
     • Article 7.12. Violation of copyright and related rights
     • Article 14.10. Illegal use of means of individualization

  5. Federal Law N 149-FZ "On information, information technologies
     and information protection" of 27.07.2006

  6. Federal Law N 98-FZ "On commercial secrecy" of 29.07.2004

