  8. Universal Copyright Convention of 06.09.1952 (as revised 1971)

  9. WIPO Copyright Treaty (WCT) of 20.12.1996

  10. WIPO Performances and Phonograms Treaty (WPPT) of 20.12.1996

  11. Agreement on Trade-Related Aspects of Intellectual Property Rights
      (TRIPS) of 15.04.1994

  12. Patent Law Treaty (PLT) of 01.06.2000

  13. International Convention for the Protection of Performers,
      Producers of Phonograms and Broadcasting Organizations
      (Rome Convention) of 26.10.1961

  14. Convention Establishing the World Intellectual Property
      Organization (WIPO) of 14.07.1967

